  m_text: "Bob was the lab\u2019s fastest success and greatest mistake able to slow
    time itself but fatally vulnerable to a single drop of water. With only one eye
    and infinite patience, he watches the world move in slow motion, waiting for
    the perfect moment to prove he\u2019s not a failed experiment."
